<title>USA: Apple Computer to unveil new software-NYT.</title>
<headline>Apple Computer to unveil new software-NYT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple Computer Inc plans to demonstrate an early version of new operating system software on which it pins its hopes for a comeback, the New York Times said.</p>
<p>In Tuesday's editions, the Times said the demonstration will be made at Apple's Worldwide Developers Conference.</p>
<p>The operating system, code-named Rhapsody, is designed to further Apple's reputation as a company that produces software that is creative yet easy to use.</p>
<p>Rhapsody is expected to be completed some time in 1998.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
